Package: libmytool1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Description: file checksum and entropy analysis library
 libmytool computes the size, CRC-32, SHA-256 digest and Shannon entropy
 of files in a single pass, behind a small, stable C ABI.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libmytool-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmytool1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: file checksum and entropy analysis library - development files
 libmytool computes the size, CRC-32, SHA-256 digest and Shannon entropy
 of files in a single pass, behind a small, stable C ABI.
 .
 This package contains the C header, the unversioned libmytool.so symlink,
 pkg-config metadata and CMake package configuration files.

Package: mytool
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: command-line file checksum and entropy analyzer
 mytool prints size, CRC-32, SHA-256 and Shannon entropy for files, emits
 sha256sum-compatible output, and verifies files against a manifest.
 .
 A systemd timer (mytool-verify.timer) checks the manifest in
 /etc/mytool/manifest.sha256 once a day.
